<title>USA: Cliffs Drilling stake increased to 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Cliffs Drilling stake increased to 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Cambridge Investments Ltd said Tuesday it has raised its stake in Cliffs Drilling Co to 6.9 percent or 516,800 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it acquired a net 145,900 shares in the Houston-based oil and gas drilling concern between January 2 and March 20 at prices ranging from $43.75 to $68.25 a share.</p>
</text>
